ronger from their previous lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288470/extras/b7e1de4b4da92c303db38efd697785f8.poster.avif?t=1766086986\" width=1138 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288470/extras/b7e1de4b4da92c303db38efd697785f8.webm?t=1766086986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288470/extras/b7e1de4b4da92c303db38efd697785f8.mp4?t=1766086986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288470/extras/0ca015aab69e92dbb540a5f9d6a639e3.avif?t=1766086986\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With every level up you get to decide in which direction your monsters will grow. Every monster has a dynamic skill pool that reacts to previous choices and other monsters you have in your team, enabling you to create powerful teams. Experiment with a myriad of unique team builds with every run!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288470/extras/5d62a88537dae10f50001c5504876b8b.poster.avif?t=1766086986\" width=800 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288470/extras/5d62a88537dae10f50001c5504876b8b.webm?t=1766086986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288470/extras/5d62a88537dae10f50001c5504876b8b.mp4?t=1766086986\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288470/extras/bab544346913a3609adfbf1b9bae8bce.avif?t=1766086986\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet various characters who will help you and your monsters throughout your journey! Uncover their stories and dig into the lore of this world - all fueled by your choices and encounters. Help liven the village up by gathering townsfolk, hearing them out, and doing what only a true Aethermancer can do!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288470/extras/742a37faa9a46b08b382aa9648b1663b.poster.avif?t=1766086986\" width=1138 height=510 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288470/extras/742a37faa9a46b08b382aa9648b1663b.webm?t=1766086986\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2288470/extras/f40416e16ca52cf66a023ee79f7eca44.avif?t=1766086986\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Aethermancer abilities to explore, sneak and fight your way through procedurally generated levels while your monsters gain Worthiness. Keep going until you lose your monsters\u2026 then come back stronger and try again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img